# Opens Proton Docs documents and spreadsheets in the web browser (#224).
# The worker gives them a docs.proton.me UDS_TARGET_URL, which Dolphin passes
# here instead of the protondrive: URL; X-KDE-Protocols=https keeps KIO from
# downloading that page to a temporary file first. Hidden from menus: it's
# only meant as these two types' handler.
[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=Proton Docs
Comment=Open Proton Docs documents and spreadsheets in the web browser
Comment[ar]=فتح مستندات Proton Docs وجداول البيانات في متصفح الويب
Comment[de]=Proton-Docs-Dokumente und -Tabellen im Webbrowser öffnen
Comment[es]=Abrir documentos y hojas de cálculo de Proton Docs en el navegador web
Comment[fr]=Ouvrir les documents et feuilles de calcul Proton Docs dans le navigateur web
Comment[hi]=Proton Docs दस्तावेज़ और स्प्रेडशीट वेब ब्राउज़र में खोलें
Comment[ja]=Proton Docs のドキュメントとスプレッドシートをウェブブラウザーで開きます
Comment[pt_BR]=Abrir documentos e planilhas do Proton Docs no navegador da web
Comment[ru]=Открывать документы и таблицы Proton Docs в веб-браузере
Comment[zh_CN]=在网页浏览器中打开 Proton Docs 文档和电子表格
Icon=internet-web-browser
Exec=xdg-open %u
NoDisplay=true
MimeType=application/vnd.proton.doc;application/vnd.proton.sheet;
X-KDE-Protocols=https
